          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP487 Earl Kitchener School&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; Happy International Geocaching Day &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Geo-Mom and I are in town for SAW XII (and general geocaching) and this time I came organized with a list of Brass Caps in the area &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_approve.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;! Following the S7: Flash Mob (super fun), I headed downtown for the Wherigo cache and to grab some Brass Caps. This one was easy to spot but just needed to be cleaned off a bit. Details have been sent to the C.O. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for another great Brass Cap, OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
